  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    charonAnimation: CharonSeatedIdle
    charonStareAnimation: CharonStareAtBowley
    bowleyAnimation: BowleyIdleFast
    cameraShake: 1
    text: <shake>CHARON, YOU SEE THIS RIGHT?!</shake>
  - speaker: 1
    charonAnimation: CharonSeatedIdle
    charonStareAnimation: CharonStareAtBowley
    bowleyAnimation: BowleyYesFast
    cameraShake: 1
    text: <bounce>THEY MAKE SUCH A GOOD COUPLE DON'T THEY?!</bounce>
  - speaker: 0
    charonAnimation: CharonComeOn
    charonStareAnimation: CharonStareAtPlayer
    bowleyAnimation: BowleyYesSlow
    cameraShake: 0
    text: <wave>Well judging by how they're looking at us, surely it wasn't all sunshine
      and rainbows?</wave>
  - speaker: 1
    charonAnimation: CharonTalkingToBowley
    charonStareAnimation: CharonStareAtBowley
    bowleyAnimation: BowleyNo
    cameraShake: 0
    text: <dangle>Charon, honey, how did <shake><?CameraShake>YOUR</shake> last relationship
      go?</dangle>
  - speaker: 0
    charonAnimation: CharonTalkingToBowley
    charonStareAnimation: CharonStareUp
    bowleyAnimation: BowleyNoSlow
    cameraShake: 0
    text: <wiggle>Look, that wasn't going to go anywhere</wiggle>
  - speaker: 1
    charonAnimation: CharonTalkingToBowley
    charonStareAnimation: CharonStareUp
    bowleyAnimation: BowleyYesFast
    cameraShake: 1
    text: <dangle><shake>OH</shake>? How do <shake>YOU</shake> know that?</dangle>
  - speaker: 0
    charonAnimation: CharonSeatedIdle
    charonStareAnimation: CharonStareAtBowley
    bowleyAnimation: BowleyYes
    cameraShake: 0
    text: <wave>Aphrodite got involved, said it wasn't going to work out</wave>
  - speaker: 1
    charonAnimation: CharonSeatedIdle
    charonStareAnimation: CharonStareAtPlayer
    bowleyAnimation: BowleyNoFast
    cameraShake: 1
    text: <shake><incr>AND YOU JUST LISTENED TO HER?</incr></shake>
